o. (event_time: 2023-06-13T20:29:00Z)\n  - Jon's dance studio is bringing its best moves for an upcoming night of performances and judging. (event_time: 2023-04-03T13:26:00Z)\n  - Some schools are participating with their best moves in an upcoming night of performances and judging. (event_time: 2023-04-03T13:26:00Z)\n  - Jon expresses that success is almost here and that 'We got this'. (event_time: 2023-01-29T14:32:00Z)\n  - Jon's dance studio will change things for lots of folks. (event_time: 2023-05-11T15:14:00Z)\n  - Gina's new store will make Gina's customers very comfortable. (event_time: 2023-02-01T00:48:00Z)\n  - Gina is asking about the opening time for the dance studio. (event_time: 2023-06-19T10:04:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - launch: Jon is opening a dance studio. Gina is looking forward to the grand opening scheduled for tomorrow. Jon previously took a trip to Rome.\n  - Gina: Gina advises Jon on marketing, is growing her online store, and asked Jon when he is opening his dance studio. She expressed excitement for his studio opening.\n  - event: Jon attended an awesome event where he met investors and received motivating advice to pursue his goals for the dance studio.\n  - performances and judging: Jon's dance studio and other schools will participate in a creative night of performances and judging.\n  - banker: Jon quit his secure 9-5 job as a banker to pursue his passion for dancing by opening a studio, despite acknowledging the difficulties.\n  - Gina: Gina informed Jon she was accepted for a part-time fashion internship at an international company; she is excited and nervous about the big change.\n  - website: Gina built a new website for customers to make orders last week and is loving the experience.\n  - Tough times: Tough times for Jon, involving losing his job, acted as a gateway and provided the push needed to pursue his dream of opening a dance studio.\n  - fashion: G