edback.\n  - new stuff: Calvin is trying to find the right balance between sticking to his sound and trying new stuff in his music, finding it exciting and motivating.\n  - music program: Calvin is supporting young musicians from a music program, finding their passion and enthusiasm inspiring.\n  - joy: Creating something people connect with that brings joy is Calvin's motivation for growth, as felt during his album party celebration.\n  - music: Calvin and an artist discussed favorite artists, art, and music's power to connect people, leading to a creative high for Calvin. Dave also noted music fosters creativity.\n  - helpful people: Calvin values supportive people for artist development and motivation, recalling how relationships sparked feelings similar to when he and friends freestyled as teenagers.\n  - Calvin: Calvin had an inspiring chat with an artist about music and art, feeling a creative high. He and Dave previously planned to meet when Dave is in Boston. Dave has taken up photography.\n  - favorite artists: Calvin and an artist discussed their favorite artists, art, and the power of music during an inspiring conversation at a Boston gala.\n  - Cal: Calvin (Cal) works with new talent, making a beat for a young artist with great music potential. He enjoys seeing his old friends who support him.\n  - Dave: Dave congratulated Calvin on his new album party, asked about the cheering, and commented that music can affect mood and help stay on track.\n  - notebook: Dave stated that writing lyrics and notes in a notebook boosts his motivation to grow.\n  - music gear: Calvin saved his music gear and favorite microphone during a flood last week. Dave offered Calvin help with his music stuff and mentioned his own music studio setup with a high-quality sound system.\n  - tu música: Dave aconsejó a Calvin que mantenerse fiel a su estilo es vital para que su música se destaque y sea única, destacando que tiene algo grande para ofrecer al mundo.\n  - current events: Ca